WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:54.920
Clearing debris from the old hut

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.320
The old ropes are rotting

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:01.820
 

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:04.340
So we must remove them and start from scratch for safety

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:09.740
Making a game plan for rebuilding the hut

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:17.440
removing the old, weak posts

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:30.080
Picking the right tree is important

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.640
This is Jake's favorite part

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.780
Cutting logs for the perimeter fence

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.340
Timber!

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:55.080
Taking breaks is important

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:19.180
There is lots to do, so we split up the tasks

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:23.920
Jarrett builds the fence

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.300
Jake works on the walls

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:38.420
While Nick collects roofing materials

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:53.620
Conversation makes working fun

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:22.260
Jake is digging a fire pit

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:28.540
Nick is making small ropes, because we ran out of lashing rope

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:52.760
Can't have a fire pit without some rocks

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.220
spreading some dirt around because why not

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.840
Praying to Chungus to keep the rains away from our village

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.480
Can't stress enough the importance of this step

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.080
The dirt must be raked

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:55.980
Making a spit for the fire pit

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:08.140
these logs are very heavy

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:11.100
and very far away

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:15.080
teamwork must be used to retrieve these logs

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:20.180
the nettles, they sting

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.020
remember to subscribe

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.540
Jake works on carving logs for a throne

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.020
Jarrett puts finishing touches on the hut

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.580
Nick goes out to search for a stone to make an axe head

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:18.900
This stick will be an axe soon

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.200
it looks like an axe..

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:48.540
..but does it cut like one?

